<section class="sec" id="services" aria-labelledby="s-t">
  <p class="kick" aria-hidden="true">What we do</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="s-t">Excavation, wet hire & labour - done tight.</h2>
  <div class="svc">
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">01</p><h3 class="svc__h">Excavation</h3><p class="svc__p">Tight-access excavation with compact machines - side access, backyards, restricted sites across the Coast, Newcastle & Sydney.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">02</p><h3 class="svc__h">Wet hire (machine + operator)</h3><p class="svc__p">Experienced operators on our gear - excavators, bobcats, posi tracks, tippers. You get the machine and the skill.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">03</p><h3 class="svc__h">Plant hire</h3><p class="svc__p">1.5-3t excavators, bobcats, posi tracks, tippers. Dry or wet hire rates - maintained, fuelled, ready to work.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">04</p><h3 class="svc__h">Civil labour hire</h3><p class="svc__p">Skilled labour for earthworks, drainage, site prep, pipe laying, concrete prep - ticketed, reliable, on-site when you need them.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">05</p><h3 class="svc__h">Bobcat & tipper combos</h3><p class="svc__p">The classic tight-access pair - bobcat loads, tipper hauls. One mobilisation, one crew, fast cycle times.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">06</p><h3 class="svc__h">Site preparation</h3><p class="svc__p">Clearing, strip & respread, bulk cut to level, pad prep, access tracks - ground ready for the next trade.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>
<div data-ux="marquee" class="ux-strip" style="overflow:hidden;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);padding:15px 0;background:#0b0d10"><div style="display:flex;gap:2.4rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:13.5px;color:#99a1ae;white-space:nowrap"><span>Excavation</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc,#ff0000)">·</span><span>Wet hire (machine + operator)</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc,#ff0000)">·</span><span>Plant hire</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc,#ff0000)">·</span><span>Civil labour hire</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc,#ff0000)">·</span><span>Bobcat & tipper combos</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc,#ff0000)">·</span><span>Site preparation</span><span class="uxdot" style="color:var(--acc,#ff0000)">·</span></div></div>


<section class="sec sec--panel" id="machines" aria-labelledby="m-t">
  <div class="inner">
  <p class="kick" aria-hidden="true">Machine strip</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="m-t">The fleet that fits.</h2>
  <div class="machine-strip">
    <article class="machine__card rv"><p class="machine__n">1.5-3t class</p><h3 class="machine__h">Mini excavators</h3><p class="machine__p">1.5t, 2.5t, 3t - rubber track, zero tail swing. Trenching, footings, pools, service runs in tight corridors.</p></article>
    <article class="machine__card rv"><p class="machine__n">Bobcat + truck</p><h3 class="machine__h">Skid steer & tipper</h3><p class="machine__p">Bobcat loads spoil, truck carts it. One crew, one mobilisation - the side-access workhorse.</p></article>
    <article class="machine__card rv"><p class="machine__n">Posi track</p><h3 class="machine__h">Tracked skid steer</h3><p class="machine__p">Low ground pressure, climbs where wheels spin. Soft ground, wet sites, finished levels without tracking mud.</p></article>
    <article class="machine__card rv"><p class="machine__n">Excavator + truck</p><h3 class="machine__h">Digger & tipper pair</h3><p class="machine__p">3t-5t excavator loads, 6w/8w tipper hauls. Bulk spoil out, VENM/ENM in - single mobilisation.</p></article>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

